cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Bioprocess Digital Twin Deployment Readiness Toolkit"
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
abstract: >-
  Browser-based toolkit implementing the role-based TRL–DRL–α framework.
  It identifies the highest operational role (R1–R3) a digital twin can
  support for a biomanufacturing system within a defined boundary and
  deployment context, and reports every unmet requirement as a
  deployment constraint.
